{"data": [{"author_id": "2108270326849187840", "created_at": "2026-10-26T17:51:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114776940972257326"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 123, "start": 119, "tag": "ETR"}]}, "id": "2114776940972257326", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GRID INTERCONNECTION ALERT: 160 MW HIGH-VOLTAGE GRID INTERCONNECTION PROJECT FILED IN MISO BY ENTERGY TEXAS / MISO () ($ETR) — TRANSFORMER BOTTLENECK (24-36M LEAD) (ER27-232-000 (SA 4891 Entergy Texas GIA S1156/S1157))\n\n• Filing Date / Queue: 2026-10-26 | MISO ER27-232-000 (SA", "url": "https://x.com/AwardTapeHq/status/2114776940972257326"}, {"author_id": "1556940919714496512", "created_at": "2026-10-26T01:35:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114531294969520297"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 235, "start": 228, "tag": "VTOMAN"}, {"end": 253, "start": 236, "tag": "SodiumIonBattery"}, {"end": 272, "start": 254, "tag": "MotorcycleBattery"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ZnMu7wRveA", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/VTOMAN_Official/status/2114531294969520297/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114530563453591552", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/ZnMu7wRveA"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/ZnMu7wRveA", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/VTOMAN_Official/status/2114531294969520297/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114530563457765376", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/ZnMu7wRveA"}]}, "id": "2114531294969520297", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Built for Motorcycle Starting. Powered by Sodium-Ion. \n\nMeet VTOMAN’s 12V Sodium-Ion Starting Batteries, engineered for reliable starts in demanding conditions.\n\n⚡300A–900A peak current\n❄️Operating temperatures as low as -40°C\n\n#VTOMAN #SodiumIonBattery #MotorcycleBattery https://t.co/ZnMu7wRveA", "url": "https://x.com/VTOMAN_Official/status/2114531294969520297"}, {"author_id": "2007993789110177792", "created_at": "2026-10-25T23:24:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114498421654708258"], "id": "2114498421654708258", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Capacity auctions tell you who showed up. Grid interconnection queues tell you who's actually serious. The gap between the two is where most wind pipelines quietly die.", "url": "https://x.com/alvarez_ro24157/status/2114498421654708258"}, {"author_id": "1658196274552909824", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:11:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114797043914842550"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/ShanuMathew93/…", "end": 228, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ShanuMathew93/status/2114794421216768058", "start": 205, "url": "https://t.co/i1zwYM3YJe"}]}, "id": "2114797043914842550", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114794421216768058", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Four superclusters above 1 GW each. That's not a data center bill, that's a power plant portfolio. My bet: the bottleneck won't be the $95B raise, it'll be grid interconnection and firm clean capacity. ⚛️ https://t.co/i1zwYM3YJe", "url": "https://x.com/ecojuanmart/status/2114797043914842550"}, {"author_id": "1851832020340740096", "created_at": "2026-10-27T00:33:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114878083102806116"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/BuPIL8iYRw", "end": 271, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LBM_NE_TECH/status/2114878083102806116/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114878062697607168", "start": 248, "url": "https://t.co/BuPIL8iYRw"}]}, "id": "2114878083102806116", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Riding the wave of global sodium-ion battery industrial development, LBM has built a comprehensive layout across the full sodium-ion battery value chain, focusing on polyanionic cathode materials with mature processes and mass production capacity. https://t.co/BuPIL8iYRw", "url": "https://x.com/LBM_NE_TECH/status/2114878083102806116"}, {"author_id": "270246051", "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:32:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114711658618843472"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/zPTN9JHdUk", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Ventureburn/status/2114711658618843472/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114711641866866688", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/zPTN9JHdUk"}, {"display_url": "x.com/Ventureburn/st…", "end": 323, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Ventureburn/status/2114711403299012909", "start": 300, "url": "https://t.co/WcNqp8mSTI"}]}, "id": "2114711658618843472", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 95, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114711403299012909", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🔋 Peak Energy Raises $108M for Sodium-Ion Energy Storage! ⚡🌱\n\nRead more in the comments ⬇️\n\nThe company is advancing sodium-ion battery technology as demand grows for scalable energy storage. Could this chemistry become a stronger alternative for the clean energy transition? https://t.co/zPTN9JHdUk https://t.co/WcNqp8mSTI", "url": "https://x.com/Ventureburn/status/2114711658618843472"}, {"author_id": "250296041", "created_at": "2026-10-27T08:06:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114992116229447739"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/WhdUfAXzU9", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IDTechEx/status/2114992116229447739/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114992113813438464", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/WhdUfAXzU9"}]}, "id": "2114992116229447739", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 59, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Sodium-Ion Batteries: From Technical Promise to Commercial Reality: Among current energy storage technologies, lithium-ion batteries (LIBs) dominate due to… www.​idtechex.​com/en/research-article/sodium-ion-batteries-from-technical-promise-to-commercial-reality/35483?rsst2id=0 https://t.co/WhdUfAXzU9", "url": "https://x.com/IDTechEx/status/2114992116229447739"}, {"author_id": "1611906439521484801", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:35:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114848378081141248"], "id": "2114848378081141248", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Data centers hit 20% of US electricity by 2035. It's at 5.9% today. Grid interconnection takes 7+ years. Hyperscalers want power in 18 months. That gap doesn't close with utility policy. It closes with off-grid generation and storage.", "url": "https://x.com/grantbmcdaniel/status/2114848378081141248"}, {"author_id": "1236583240065929216", "created_at": "2026-10-27T07:19:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114980294147330231"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 266, "start": 258, "tag": "Battery"}, {"end": 277, "start": 267, "tag": "SodiumIon"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/jN8r94qe3H", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/OUTDOBATTERY/status/2114980294147330231/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114980239126519808", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/jN8r94qe3H"}]}, "id": "2114980294147330231", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "❄️Don’t wait for spring🏍️\nSnowy peaks. Morning light. One road calling.\n⚡Sodium-ion starting power, even at −30°C\nMeet the OUTDO Sodium-ion Motorcycle Starter Battery — made for riders who are ready to embrace the cold.\n🌄Your next ride doesn’t have to wait.\n#Battery #SodiumIon https://t.co/jN8r94qe3H", "url": "https://x.com/OUTDOBATTERY/status/2114980294147330231"}, {"author_id": "1453471240228786179", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:06:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114795699032486186"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ekzuZkplxx", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/nextthingtech/status/2114795699032486186/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2105720887353679872", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/ekzuZkplxx"}]}, "id": "2114795699032486186", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "When you hear “battery,” you probably think lithium-ion.\nBut batteries can use completely different chemistries.\n\nOne of them is sodium-ion.\n\nInstead of relying primarily on lithium, sodium-ion batteries use sodium — an extremely abundant element.\n\nWhy does that matter?\n\nBecause https://t.co/ekzuZkplxx", "url": "https://x.com/nextthingtech/status/2114795699032486186"}, {"author_id": "175301859", "created_at": "2026-10-26T11:46:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114685097115029857"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 225, "start": 216, "tag": "SIEW2026"}], "mentions": [{"end": 214, "id": "2277850368", "start": 201, "username": "shripadynaik"}]}, "id": "2114685097115029857", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "India is promoting regional grid interconnection through initiatives such as One Sun, One World, One Grid to deepen cross-border electricity cooperation and strengthen regional energy security, shared @shripadynaik. #SIEW2026", "url": "https://x.com/SIEW_sg/status/2114685097115029857"}, {"author_id": "714684004495204352", "created_at": "2026-10-26T08:42:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114638829885759715"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "(Yicai) Oct. 26 -- Ronbay New Energy Technology, the leading supplier of sodium-ion battery cathode materials for Contemporary Amperex Technology, said it will invest CNY3.6 billion (USD536.3 million) to further ramp up relevant production, less than three months after unveiling plans to spend CNY4.7 billion in its first large project in the fast-emerging segment. Ronbay plans to build a sodium-ion battery cathode material plant with an annual production capacity of 200,000 tons in Xiangyang, China's", "display_url": "buff.ly/Cl9mb4z", "end": 107, "expanded_url": "https://buff.ly/Cl9mb4z", "images": [{"height": 510, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114638844331020288/k_fFPnyh?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 770}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114638844331020288/k_fFPnyh?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 84, "status": 200, "title": "China’s Ronbay Injects USD536.3 Million to Boost Sodium-Ion Battery Material Output", "unwound_url": "https://www.yicaiglobal.com/news/chinas-ronbay-injects-usd5363-million-to-boost-sodium-ion-battery-material-output", "url": "https://t.co/NBLmnCzdl5"}]}, "id": "2114638829885759715", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 582, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China’s Ronbay Injects USD536.3 Million to Boost Sodium-Ion Battery Material Output https://t.co/NBLmnCzdl5", "url": "https://x.com/yicaichina/status/2114638829885759715"}, {"author_id": "937500466526806017", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:12:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114782164722254015"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "msn.com/en-us/money/ge…", "end": 100, "expanded_url": "https://www.msn.com/en-us/money/general/28-sodium-ion-materials-reveal-paths-to-faster-charging-longer-battery-life/ar-AA2fRLQX?ocid=socialshare", "start": 77, "unwound_url": "https://www.msn.com/en-us/money/general/28-sodium-ion-materials-reveal-paths-to-faster-charging-longer-battery-life/ar-AA2fRLQX?ocid=socialshare", "url": "https://t.co/X4xmN9c41X"}]}, "id": "2114782164722254015", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "28 sodium-ion materials reveal paths to faster charging, longer battery life https://t.co/X4xmN9c41X", "url": "https://x.com/anurup1973/status/2114782164722254015"}, {"author_id": "142325969", "created_at": "2026-10-27T08:10:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114992999310700734"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/adoc6qeh6y", "end": 106, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EV_Research/status/2114992999310700734/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114992997221990400", "start": 83, "url": "https://t.co/adoc6qeh6y"}]}, "id": "2114992999310700734", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 417, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Sodium-Ion Batteries: From Technical Promise to Commercial Reality dlvr.​it/TW4RcN https://t.co/adoc6qeh6y", "url": "https://x.com/EV_Research/status/2114992999310700734"}, {"author_id": "1608813562029559808", "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:55:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114717511673635206"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Desalination brine, a hypersaline byproduct of water treatment processes, represents an underutilized sodium feedstock with significant potential for battery material production. In this work, we report a streamlined rapid one-step synthesis (ROSS) method ...", "display_url": "chemrxiv.org/doi/full/10.26…", "end": 162, "expanded_url": "https://chemrxiv.org/doi/full/10.26434/chemrxiv.15011016/v1?af=R", "images": [{"height": 773, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114717516509704192/9Lj1PJa9?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1994}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114717516509704192/9Lj1PJa9?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 139, "status": 200, "title": "Rapid One-Step Synthesis of Sodium-Ion Battery Cathodes from Desalination Waste: A Sustainable Approach to High-Performance Energy Storage | ChemRxiv", "unwound_url": "https://chemrxiv.org/doi/full/10.26434/chemrxiv.15011016/v1?af=R", "url": "https://t.co/C87Np2QhaH"}]}, "id": "2114717511673635206", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 328, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Rapid One-Step Synthesis of Sodium-Ion Battery Cathodes from Desalination Waste: A Sustainable Approach to High-Performance Energy Storage\nhttps://t.co/C87Np2QhaH", "url": "https://x.com/EKL_Batteries/status/2114717511673635206"}, {"author_id": "2042510707447529473", "created_at": "2026-10-26T02:44:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114548669177634911"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/jal9YAwZBU", "end": 170, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Jstarypower/status/2114548669177634911/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114548185679233024", "start": 147, "url": "https://t.co/jal9YAwZBU"}]}, "id": "2114548669177634911", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "0V shipping ≠ skip compliance. Not all sodium-ion cells support it. Ask your supplier before booking — and confirm certifications for your market. https://t.co/jal9YAwZBU", "url": "https://x.com/Jstarypower/status/2114548669177634911"}, {"author_id": "2111357007848681472", "created_at": "2026-10-25T22:10:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114479734264672329"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 139, "start": 122, "tag": "RechargionEnergy"}, {"end": 150, "start": 140, "tag": "Punebased"}, {"end": 170, "start": 151, "tag": "SodiumIonBatteries"}], "urls": [{"description": "Rechargion Energy's sodium-ion batteries, built in Pune from Indian materials, passed ARAI safety tests and now power their first customer's solar system.", "display_url": "exceptional.technology/rechargion-sod…", "end": 120, "expanded_url": "https://exceptional.technology/rechargion-sodium-ion-batteries-pune-india/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114479744037314560/luLD3C9J?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114479744037314560/luLD3C9J?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 97, "status": 200, "title": "Rechargion: Pune's Sodium-Ion Batteries Built From Salt", "unwound_url": "https://exceptional.technology/rechargion-sodium-ion-batteries-pune-india/", "url": "https://t.co/iR4rV0ImNT"}]}, "id": "2114479734264672329", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "From Salt to Storage: Inside Rechargion, the Pune Startup Building India's Sodium-Ion Batteries\n\nhttps://t.co/iR4rV0ImNT\n\n#RechargionEnergy #Punebased #SodiumIonBatteries", "url": "https://x.com/excep_tech/status/2114479734264672329"}, {"author_id": "1575673381378084864", "created_at": "2026-10-26T02:54:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114551243758543327"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/BRcmW610rC", "end": 177, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JackXia45715971/status/2114551243758543327/video/1", "media_key": "13_2114550949993959424", "start": 154, "url": "https://t.co/BRcmW610rC"}]}, "id": "2114551243758543327", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Not every sodium-ion cell supports 0V shipment. For importers, the key is simple: confirm the shipping spec and required certifications before you order. https://t.co/BRcmW610rC", "url": "https://x.com/JackXia45715971/status/2114551243758543327"}, {"author_id": "1826503959500259328", "created_at": "2026-10-26T06:13:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114601223039115737"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "India’s transition toward a renewable-intensive energy system has incentivized the need for alternative energy storage technologies that are cost-effective, safe, and compatible with national resource availability. In this context, Sodium-Ion Batteries (SIBs) have emerged as a strategically relevant option, particularly for stationary and grid-scale applications. However, a consolidated assessment of India’s readiness for SIB development, encompassing scientific progress, industrial capability, and policy support, remains limited. This study attempts to address the gap through an India-centric, perception-based survey designed to evaluate challenges and priorities associated with SIB research and deployment. An online questionnaire was administered across India, yielding responses from 102 Indian participants actively engaged in sodium ion battery research who have already published work in the field. The survey integrated Likert-scale perception statements, multiple-choice priority qu", "display_url": "dialogue.ias.ac.in/index.php/dial…", "end": 229, "expanded_url": "https://dialogue.ias.ac.in/index.php/dialogue/article/view/126", "start": 206, "status": 200, "title": "A Survey on Sodium-Ion Batteries: Perspectives from Indian Researchers and Professionals", "unwound_url": "https://dialogue.ias.ac.in/index.php/dialogue/article/view/126", "url": "https://t.co/uN6QGlXePd"}]}, "id": "2114601223039115737", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 442, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "New in Dialogue: Phogat et al report on a survey of Indian researchers working on Sodium Ion Batteries, querying them about their perception of strengths, weaknesses and bottlenecks in this important area.\nhttps://t.co/uN6QGlXePd", "url": "https://x.com/IAScDialogue/status/2114601223039115737"}, {"author_id": "41992937", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114786642519273528"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Peak Energy designs a